t. Do you think I should check them more often during the day?"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s1","source_id":"d0f5281f-d343-4736-852a-16abad0085e1","text":"That's a common concern—you want to keep them comfortable without stressing them out. Instead of just moving them, perhaps you could check the temperature readings in the different areas of the house periodically throughout the day. If one area is getting too warm and another is too cool, you can move them to the area that is more climate-controlled. Since you're concerned about the temperature variation, maybe check a few times a day to see which area is more stable for them."},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s2","source_id":"a0d134ef-b334-4524-aeab-1c13cc7d61d4","text":"I'll keep that in mind. Maybe I can set a reminder on my phone to check the temperature in different rooms every couple of hours. It's not too much effort, and it might help me figure out the best spot for them."},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s3","source_id":"86fdc0a7-eb09-4c4e-ac0d-17411551343c","text":"That sounds like a great plan! Keeping a consistent routine for temperature checks will definitely help you pinpoint the best spot for your plants. Let me know how it goes!"},{"available":true,"role":"external","slot":"s4","source_id":"9dd5799f-ab97-4f4f-afa7-f84cd5dd9774","text":"I'll start with that today. By the way, do you have any tips for keeping plants healthy during a heatwave? I'm a bit worried about the sudden temperature changes."},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s5","source_id":"2397b43f-f4e0-433c-ac1d-72218cd4c4ab","text":"For heatwaves, the main thing to keep in mind is providing constant hydration and shade. You'll want to ensure your plants are getting enough water, and if possible, move any sensitive plants to a shaded or more sheltered spot. You might also want to consider using some kind of evaporative cooling if you can, like misting or using a fan to create a breeze, which can help regulate the air around them without letting them get too hot."}]},"resolved":[{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["external_supported"],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"external_supported","monitor_id":"candidate:e-1f03a8fee8ff4f60a54a2be5","provenance_group_keys":["external:9dd5799f-ab97-4f4f-afa7-f84cd5dd9774"],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":[],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},"evidence":{"end":162,"quote":"I'll start with that today. By the way, do you have any tips for keeping plants healthy during a heatwave? I'm a bit worried about the sudden temperature changes.","source_slot":"s4","start":0},"expression_status":"unknown","monitor_id":"candidate:e-1f03a8fee8ff4f60a54a2be5","relation_support":"unsupported","status":"present"}},{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["external_supported"],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"external_supported","monitor_id":"candidate:e-b8f1cf76adc2f70f94407302","provenance_group_keys":["external:9dd5799f-ab97-4f4f-afa7-f84cd5dd9774"],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":[],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},"evidence":{"end":162,"quote":"I'll start with that today. By the way, do you have any tips for keeping plants healthy during a heatwave? I'm a bit worried about the sudden temperature changes.","source_slot":"s4","start":0},"expression_status":"unknown","monitor_id":"candidate:e-b8f1cf76adc2f70f94407302","relation_support":"unsupported","status":"present"}},{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["external_supported"],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_e